    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">7318</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">7514</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_14-DEFENSIO-7892-8424">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#defensio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_14-DEFENSIO-7892-8424" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">ipsamque domum cum dicto Iardinello et omnibus suis iuribus dicto Monasterio Sancte Lucie libere et imperpetuum ab omnibus hominibus defendere salvo annuo censu tareni unius et granorum decem debitorum per ipsam domum seu dictum iardinellum domine Maselle Frisiarie de Barolo, quem censum ipsum monasterium dicte domine Maselle anno quolibet imperpetuum solvere teneatur, denunciandi necessitate evictionis tempore per eundem magistrum Ciccum venditorem pro se et suis heredibus dicto monasterio et monialibus suis ex pacto remissa.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_14-DEFENSIO-7892-8424</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_14-DEFENSIO-7892-8424">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_14" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_14-DEFENSIO-7892-8424" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_14-DEFENSIO-7892-8424">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">7892</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">8424</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_14-OBLIGATIO-8425-9720">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_14-OBLIGATIO-8425-9720" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Pro quibus omnibus et singulis adimplendis per ipsum magistrum Ciccum et suos heredes eisdem priorisse monialibus et conventui et eis succedentibus inviolabiliter observandis et contra non contraveniendo voluntarie prefatus magister Ciccus venditor eidem fratri Iohanni. Presenti recipienti et stipulanti ab eo procuratorio nomine quo supra anteposuit ipothecavit et obligavit omnia et singula bona sua et heredum suorum mobilia et stabilia licita et illicita presencia et futura existencia ubicumque cum potestate capiendi bona ipsa per ipsas priorissam moniales et conventum et sicut causarum autem propria nullius proinde curie iudicis presidis seu pretoris expectata licencia seu mandato ipsaque bona incontinenti vendendi et quolibet alienacionis titulo distrahendi servatis vel non servatis sollempnitatibus iuris et facti que in talibus requiruntur a iure donec prelecta omnia et singula, que et qualiter preleguntur, per ipsum magistrum Ciccum venditorem et suos heredes ipsis priorisse monialibus et conventui et successoribus suis adimpleantur et observentur et se proinde tam iudicio quam extra iudicium presentes dicto quoque magistro Cicco venditore et suis heredibus defendentibus ipsi monasterio anteposicionem et obligacionem ipsas et quibus eas vendiderunt ab omnibus hominibus.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_14-OBLIGATIO-8425-9720</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_14-OBLIGATIO-8425-9720">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_14" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_14-OBLIGATIO-8425-9720" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_14-OBLIGATIO-8425-9720">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">8425</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">9720</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_14-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-9721-10696">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_14-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-9721-10696" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Contra que omnia et singula vel aliquod premissorum si dictus magister Ciccus venditor vel sui heredes fecerint et prelecta omnia et singula, que et qualiter preleguntur, eisdem priorisse monialibus et conventui et succedentibus eis non adimpleverint et observaverint duplum ipsius pecunie presentacis, precii scilicet vendicionis, pene nomine solvere et componere teneantur et debeant, medietatem scilicet ipsius pene dictis priorisse monialibus et conventui et succedentibus eis et reliquam medietatem pene predicte curie regie vel illi curie coram qua reclamacio ipsa seu querela exinde forte fiet et me predicto notario puplico tamquam persona puplica nomine e et pro parte ipsius curie et dicto procuratore procuratorio nomine quo supra penas ipsas sollempniter et legitime stipulantibus quibus penis solutis vel non solutis aut graciose remissis, presens nichilominus instrumentum cum eadem adieccione penarum et omnibus in eo contentis semper in suo robore perseveret.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_14-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-9721-10696</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_14-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-9721-10696">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_14" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_14-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-9721-10696" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_14-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-9721-10696">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">9721</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">10696</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_14-RENUNTIATIO-10697-12074">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#renuntiatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_14-RENUNTIATIO-10697-12074" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Super quibus omnibus et eorum singulis voluntarie dictus magister Ciccus venditor pro se et suis heredibus eidem procuratori presenti recipienti et stipulanti ab eo predicto nomine quo supra renunciavit expresse et ex certa eius scientia speciali excepcioni doli mali, metus et in factum accioni, excepcioni predicte rei aliter geste quam scripte et presentis non sic celebrati contractus omni et utriusque iuris auxilo canonici et civilis iuri scripto et non scripto usui consuetudinario, constitucionario longo bardo expecioni ipsius precii per eumque vendicione non recepti et habiti et per ipsum emptore sibi non nullam in assegnati legi rem maioris precii per quam deceptis in vendicionibus ultra dimidiam iusti precii subvenitur iuri legi consuetudini, que penam prohibent in contractibus adhiberi adhibitam non valere consuetudini qua cavetur quod pena apposita in contractu nullum sortiatur effectum singulisque aliis iuribus legibus excepcionibus consuetudinibus constitucionibus privilegiis litteris usibus auxiliis beneficiis remediis et statutis quibus seu ipsorum aliquo prefatus magister Ciccus venditor vel sui heredes uti seu iuvare se possent et a presenti obligacione tueri et huius scripti tenor posset, in toto vel in parte minui vel infrangi et specialiter iuri dicenti generalem renunciacionem non valere legi ecciam prohibenti talem renunciacionem fieri.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_14-RENUNTIATIO-10697-12074</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_14-RENUNTIATIO-10697-12074">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_14" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_14-RENUNTIATIO-10697-12074" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_14-RENUNTIATIO-10697-12074">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">10697</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">12074</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_14-IURAMENTUM-12075-12483">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#iuramentum" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_14-IURAMENTUM-12075-12483" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Maioris quoque securitatis causa voluntarie prefatus magister Ciccus eidem procuratori presenti et recipienti iuravit supra sancta dei evangelia per eum corporaliter tacta predicta omnia et singula que et qualiter preleguntur eisdem priorisse monialiam et conventui et eis succedentibus adimplere attendere et observare et contra non facere dicere opponere vel venire de iure vel de facto seu modo quocumque.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_14-IURAMENTUM-12075-12483</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_14-IURAMENTUM-12075-12483">
