  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_18-OBLIGATIO-6150-7609">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_18-OBLIGATIO-6150-7609" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Pro quibus omnibus et singulis adimplendis et inviolabiliter observandis per eosdem venditricem et defensorem vel eorum heredes dicte sorori Petrelle et suis successoribus, voluntarie prefati venditrix et defensor voluntarie dicto fratri Nicolao, presenti et stipulanti ab eis ut supra, anteposuerunt ypo thecaverunt et obligaverunt omnia et singula bona eorum et cuiuslibet ipsorum mobilia et stabilia licita et illicita presencia et futura, existencia ubicumque, cum potestate capiendi intrandi et apprehendendi bona ipsa per ipsam sororem Petrellam aut successores suos in dicto monasterio, auctoritate sua propria, nullius proinde curie iudicis presidis vel pretoris exspectata licencia seu mandato, set solo presentis instrumenti vigore ipsaque bona incontinenti vendendi et quolibet alienacionis titulo distrahendi vel in solutum iusto et competenti precio retinendi, servatis vel non servatis iuris et facti sollempnitatibus, que in talibus requiruntur a iure, donec predicta omnia et singula, que et qualiter preleguntur, eidem sorori Petrelle et suis successoribus per eosdem venditricem et defensorem adimpleantur et observentur cum integra refectione et emenda omnium damnorum expensarum et interesse in iudicio vel extra et se inde penitus conservent indempnes, ipsisque venditrice et defensore defendentibus antepositionem et obligationem ipsas dicte sorori Petrelle et suis successoribus et quibus ipsa bona vendita fuerint ab omnibus hominibus.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_18-OBLIGATIO-6150-7609</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_18-OBLIGATIO-6150-7609">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_18" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_18-OBLIGATIO-6150-7609" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_18-OBLIGATIO-6150-7609">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6150</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">7609</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_18-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7610-8669">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_18-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7610-8669" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Contra que omnia et singula vel aliquid premissorum si prefati venditrix et defensor fecerint vel alter ipsorum fecerit et prelecta omnia et singula, que et qualiter preleguntur, eidem sorori Petrelle vel suis successoribus in dicto monasterio non adimpleverint et observaverint, pene nomine componant et solvant, seu componere et solvere teneantur et debeant duplum dicte pecunie quantitatis, precii scilicet vendicionis domus ipsius, medietatem videlicet dicte pene dicte sorori Petrelle monasterio et suis successoribus et reliquam medietatem pene eiusdem curie regie vel reginali aut illi curie ubi de predictis fuerit exinde proclamatum; ipsoque fratre Nicolao nomine et pro parte ipsius sororis Petrelle et eius monasterio et successoribus et me prefato notario publico, tanquam persona publica, pro parte ipsius curie, penas ipsas sollemniter et legitime stipulantibus; quibus penis solutis vel non solutis aut graciose remissis, presens nichilominus instrumentum cum eadem adiectione penarum et omnibus in eo contentis semper in suo robore perseveret.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_18-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7610-8669</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_18-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7610-8669">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_18" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_18-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7610-8669" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_18-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7610-8669">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">7610</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">8669</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_18-RENUNTIATIO-8670-10219">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#renuntiatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_18-RENUNTIATIO-8670-10219" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Super quibus omnibus et eorum singulis prefati venditrix et defensor voluntarie dicto fratri Nicolao, presenti et stipulanti ab eis nominibus quibus supra, renunciaverunt expresse et ex certa eorum scientia specialiter excepcioni doli mali vis metus et in factum actioni, excepcioni predicte rei aliter geste quam scripte et presentis non sic celebrati contractus, privilegio fori, beneficio restitucionis in integrum, legi de primo principali conveniendo, excepcioni predicte pecunie, precii scilicet vendicionis domus ipsius, non recepti nec habiti, auxilio velleani senatus consulti legi rem maioris precii per quam deceptis in vendicionibus ultra dimidium iusti precii subvenitur, omni legum et utriusque iuris auxilio canonici et civilis, iuri scripto et non scripto edito vel edendo, usui consuetudinario constitucio nario vel longobardo, iuri legi et consuetudini, que penam in contractibus prohibent adhiberi et adhibitam non valere, consuetudini qua cavetur quod pena apposita in contractu nullum sortiatur effectum singulisque aliis iuribus legibus excepcionibus privilegiis literis usibus auxiliis beneficiis remediis et statutis, quibus seu ipsorum aliquo uti seu iuvare se possent et a presenti obligacione tueri et huius scripti tenor posset in parte vel in toto minui vel infringi et specialiter iuri dicenti generalem renunciacionem non valere, legi etiam prohibenti talem renunciacionem fieri; certiorata prius prefata Zocia per me prefatum iudicem de omnibus legibus excepcionibus et renunciacionibus predictis ac earum effectibus.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_18-RENUNTIATIO-8670-10219</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_18-RENUNTIATIO-8670-10219">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_18" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_18-RENUNTIATIO-8670-10219" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_18-RENUNTIATIO-8670-10219">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">8670</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">10219</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_18-IURAMENTUM-10220-10741">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#iuramentum" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_18-IURAMENTUM-10220-10741" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Maioris quoque per securitatis causa, predicta Zocia venditrix et notarius Nicolaus vel semper voluntarie dicto fratri Nicolao presenti et recipenti ab eis nominibus quibus supra iuravemur ad sancta dei evangelia per eos et unumquemque ipsorum corporaliter manu tacta predicta omnia et et singula que et qualiter preleguntur eidem sorori Petrelle monasterio et suis succeoribus adimplere, attendere et observare et contra ea vel eorum aliquid non facere dicere opponere vel venire de iure vel de facto seu modo quocumque.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_18-IURAMENTUM-10220-10741</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_18-IURAMENTUM-10220-10741">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_18" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_18-IURAMENTUM-10220-10741" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_18-IURAMENTUM-10220-10741">
