  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_19-DEFENSIO-6290-6533">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#defensio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_19-DEFENSIO-6290-6533" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">dictum ius annui census, ut supra venditum, libere defendere antistare et exibigere dicto monasterio ipsique sorori Mitule ab omnibus hominibus, denunciandi necessitate eviccionis tempore per ipsos venditores dicto monasterio ex pacto remissa.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_19-DEFENSIO-6290-6533</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_19-DEFENSIO-6290-6533">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_19" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_19-DEFENSIO-6290-6533" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_19-DEFENSIO-6290-6533">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6290</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6533</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_19-PRECARIUM-6534-6970">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#precarium" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_19-PRECARIUM-6534-6970" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Quod ius annui census venditum ipsi venditores constituerunt se ex nunc precario nomine et pro parte dicti monasterii tenere et eciam possidere, volentes expresse quod dicta precaria possessio et assignacio per fustem seu quasi hic tantum operentur et valeant, quantum se dictum ius annui census fuisset corporaliter seu quasi assignatum dicto monasterio quod precarium ipsum monasterium possit cum voluerit propria auctoritate revocare</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_19-PRECARIUM-6534-6970</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_19-PRECARIUM-6534-6970">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_19" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_19-PRECARIUM-6534-6970" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_19-PRECARIUM-6534-6970">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6534</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6970</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_19-OBLIGATIO-8178-9524">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_19-OBLIGATIO-8178-9524" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">pro quibus omnibus et singulis adimplendis et inviolabiliter observandis per ipsos venditores et eorum alium dicto monasterio et monaialibus eius et voluntate sue sorori Mitule presenti et stipulanti ab eos et quolibet ipsorum ut supra anteposuerunt ypothecaverunt et obligaverunt omnia et singula bona eorum et cuiuslibet eorum mobilia et stabilia licita et illicita presencia et futura, existencia ubicumque, cum potestate capiendi intrandi et apprehendendi bona ipsa per ipsum monasterium auctoritate sua propria nullius proinde curie iudicis presidis et pretoris exspectata licencia seu mandato, set solo presentis instrumenti vigore ipsaque bona incontinenti vendendi et quolibet alienacionis titulo distrahendi vel in solutum iusto et competenti precio retinendi, servatis vel non servatis iuris et facti sollempnitatibus, que in talibus requiruntur a iure, donec predicta omnia et singula, que et qualiter preleguntur, eidem monasterio et monialibus eius per eosdem venditores vel alterum ipsorum adimpleantur et observentur cum integra refectione et emenda omnium dampnorum expensarum et interesse et se inde penitus conserventur indemnes ipsorumque venditoribus et eorum heredibus et quolibet eorum defendentibus anteposicionem et obligacionem ipsas monesterio et eius monialibus et quibus ipsa bona vendita fuerint ab omnibus hominibus.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_19-OBLIGATIO-8178-9524</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_19-OBLIGATIO-8178-9524">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_19" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_19-OBLIGATIO-8178-9524" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_19-OBLIGATIO-8178-9524">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">8178</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">9524</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_19-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-9525-10459">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_19-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-9525-10459" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Contra que omnia et singula vel aliquid premissorum si prefati venditores vel alios ipsorum fecerit vel fecimus et predicta omnia et singula que et qualiter preleguntur eidem monasterio et eius monialibus non adimpleverint et observaverint pene nomine componant et solvant seu solvere et componere teneantur et debeant duplum dicte pecunie vendicionis census predicti, medietatem videlicet dicte pene dicto monasterio et eius monialibus et reliquam me dietatem pene eiusdem curie Regie vel Reginali aut illi curie ubi de predictis fuerit exinde proclamatum ipsaque sorore Mictula nomine et et pro parte ipsius monasterii et dicte prefato notario puplico tamquam persona puplica pro parte ipsius curie penas ipsas sollemniter et legitime stipulantibus quibus penis solutis vel non solutis aut graciose remissis, presens nichilominus instrumentum cum eadem adiectione penarum et omnibus in eo contentis semper in suo robore perse veret.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_19-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-9525-10459</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_19-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-9525-10459">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_19" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_19-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-9525-10459" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_19-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-9525-10459">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">9525</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">10459</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_19-RENUNTIATIO-10460-11675">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#renuntiatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_19-RENUNTIATIO-10460-11675" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Super quibus omnibus et eorum singulis prefati venditores voluntarie dicte sorori Mictule, presenti et stipulanti ab eis ut supra. Renunciaverunt expresse et ex certa eorum scientia specialiter excepcioni doli mali vis metus et in factum actioni excepcioni predicte rei aliter geste quam scripte et presentis non sic celebrati contractus, privilegio fori, beneficio restitucionis in integrum, legem rem maioris precii per quam deceptis in vendicionibus ultra dimidium iusti precii subvenitur, omni legem et utriusque iuris auxilio canonici et civilis, iuri scripto et non scripto edito vel edendo, usui consuetudinario constitucionario vel longobardo, iuri legi et consuetudini, que penam in contractibus prohibent adhiberi et adhibitam non valere consuetudini qua cavetur quod pena apposita in contractu nullum sortiatur effectum singulis per aliis iuribus legibus excepcionibus privilegiis literis usibus auxiliis beneficiis remediis et statutis quibus seu ipsorum aliquo uti seu iuvare se possent et a presenti obligacione tueri et huius scripti tenor posset in parte vel in toto minui vel infringi et specialiter iuri dicenti generalem renunciacionem non valere legi etiam prohibenti talem renunciacionem fieri.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_19-RENUNTIATIO-10460-11675</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_19-RENUNTIATIO-10460-11675">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_19" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_19-RENUNTIATIO-10460-11675" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_19-RENUNTIATIO-10460-11675">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">10460</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">11675</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_19-IURAMENTUM-11676-12188">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#iuramentum" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_19-IURAMENTUM-11676-12188" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Maioris quoque securitatis causa prefati Petruccius et Nicolaus venditores voluntarie dicte sorori Mictule presenti et recipienti ab eis et unoquoque ipsorum ut supra iuraverunt ad sancta dei evangelia per eos et unumquemque ipsorum corporaliter manibus tacta predicta omnia et et singula que et qualiter preleguntur eidem sorori Micutule, monasterio et eius monialibus adimplere attendere et observare et contra ea vel eorum aliquid non facere dicere opponere vel venire de iure vel de facto seu modo quocumque.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_19-IURAMENTUM-11676-12188</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_19-IURAMENTUM-11676-12188">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_19" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_19-IURAMENTUM-11676-12188" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_19-IURAMENTUM-11676-12188">
