  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_20-OBLIGATIO-7461-8875">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_20-OBLIGATIO-7461-8875" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">pro quibus omnibus et singulis adimplendis et inviolabiliter observandis per eo supradicti venditoris vel alteri ipsorum ut supra dicte emptirci et suis successoris prefati venditores volere dicere [...] presenti et stipulanti ab eis per se et dicto monasterio anteposuerunt ypothecaverunt et obligaverunt omnia et singula bona eorum et cuiuslibet ipsorum mobilia et stabilia licita et illicita presencia et futura, existencia ubicumque, cum potestate capiendi intrandi et apprehendendi bona ipsa per ipsam emptoricem vel monasterium prefactum auctoritate eorum propria nullius proinde curie iudicis presidis et pretoris exspectata licencia seu mandato solo presentis instrumenti vigore ipsaque bona incontinenti vendendi et quolibet alienacionis titulo distrahendi vel in solutum iusto et competenti precio retinendi, servatis vel non servatis iuris et facti sollempnitatibus que in talibus requiruntur a iure, donec predicta omnia et singula que et qualiter preleguntur, eidem emptrici et monasterio adimpleantur et observentur per eosdem venditores vel alterum ipsorum cum refectione et emenda omnium dampnorum expensarum et interesse quas et que esse fuerunt quomodo et se inde penitus conservent indempnes ipsisque vendi toribus et quolibet eorum vel eorum heredibus defendentibus anteposiciones et obligaciones ipsas dicte emptrici et ipsi monasterio et quibus ipsa bona vendita fuerint ab omnibus hominibus.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_20-OBLIGATIO-7461-8875</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_20-OBLIGATIO-7461-8875">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_20" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_20-OBLIGATIO-7461-8875" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_20-OBLIGATIO-7461-8875">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">7461</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">8875</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_20-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-8876-9771">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_20-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-8876-9771" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Contra que omnia et singula vel aliquid premissorum si prefati venditores facerint vel alter ipsorum fecerit et predicta omnia et singula que et qualiter preleguntur eidem emptrici et monasterio non adimpleverint et observaverint pene nomine componant et solvant seu conpo nere et solvere teneantur et debeant duplum dicte pecunie precii scilicet vendicionis census predicti, medietatem videlicet dicte pene dicto monasterio et reliquam medietatem pene eiusdem cuire Regie vel Reginali curie ubi de predictis fuerit exinde proclamatum ipsaque sorore Mictula pro se et dicto monasterio et me prefato notario puplico tamquam persona puplica pro parte ipsius curie penas ipsas sollemniter et legitime stipulantibus quibus penis solutis vel non solutis aut gra ciose remissis presens nichilominus instrumentum cum eadem adiectione penarum et omnibus in eo contentis semper in suo robore preserveret.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_20-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-8876-9771</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_20-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-8876-9771">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_20" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_20-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-8876-9771" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_20-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-8876-9771">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">8876</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">9771</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_20-RENUNTIATIO-9772-10991">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#renuntiatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_20-RENUNTIATIO-9772-10991" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Super quibus omnibus et eorum singulis prefati venditores voluntarie dicte emptrici, presenti et stipulanti ab eis ut supra renunciaverunt expresse et ex certa eorum scientia speciali excepcioni doli mali vis et metus et in factum accioni, excepcioni predicte rei aliter geste quam scripte et presentis non sic celebrati contractus, privilegio fori, legi de duobus reis in solidum obligatis et legi rem maioris precii per quam deceptis in vendicionibus ultra dimidium iusti pretii subvenitur et omni legum et utriusque iuris auxilio canonici et civilis, iuri scripto et non scripto edito vel edendo, usui consuetudinario constitucionario vel longobardo iuri legi et consuetudini, que penam in contractibus prohibent adhiberi et adhibitam non valere, consuetudini qua cavetur quod pena apposita in contractu nullum sortiatur effectum singulisque aliis iuribus legibus excepcionibus privilegiis literis usibus auxiliis beneficiis remediis et statutis, quibus seu ipsorum aliquo uti seu iuvare se possent et a presenti obligatione tueri et huius scripti tenor posset in parte, vel in toto minui vel infringi et specialiter iuri dicenti generalem renunciacionem non valere, legi etiam prohibenti talem renunciacionem fieri.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_20-RENUNTIATIO-9772-10991</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_20-RENUNTIATIO-9772-10991">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_20" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_20-RENUNTIATIO-9772-10991" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_20-RENUNTIATIO-9772-10991">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">9772</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">10991</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_20-IURAMENTUM-10992-11483">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#iuramentum" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_20-IURAMENTUM-10992-11483" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Maioris quoque securitatis causa prefati Petruccius et Nicolaus venditores voluntarie dicte sorori Mictule emptrici presenti et recipienti ab eis unoquoque ipsorum iuraverunt ad sancta dei evangelia per eos et unum quemque ipsorum corporaliter manibus tacta predicta omnia et singula que et qualiter preleguntur dicte emptrici et prefato monasterio adimplere attendere et observare et contra ea vel eorum aliquid non facere dicere opponere vel venire de iure vel de facto seu modo quocumque.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_20-IURAMENTUM-10992-11483</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_20-IURAMENTUM-10992-11483">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_20" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_20-IURAMENTUM-10992-11483" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_20-IURAMENTUM-10992-11483">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">10992</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">11483</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
