  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_21-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-15259-16583">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_21-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-15259-16583" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Contra que omnia et singula si prefati Antonella vendi trix et Mianus eius defensor vel eorum heredes et successores aut alter ipsorum in solidum fecerint seu fecerit et prelecta omnia et singula que et qualiter perleguntur eisdem monialibus et abbatisse seu monasterio et ecclesie et successoribus earum non adimpleverint attenderint et observaverint pene nomine dent et componant, seu dare et componere teneantur, sicque promiserunt et convenerunt pro se ipsis et eorum heredibus et successoribus prefata venditrix et defensor duplum quantitatis precii supradicti medietatem scilicet ipsius pene dicte abbatisse et monialibus aut dicto monasterio et ecclesie seu successoribus eorum et reliquam eiusdem pene medietatem curie Regie et Reginali aut illi curie coram qua reclamacio seu querela exinde forte fiet et me predicto notario publico tamquam persona puplica nomine et pro parte ipsius curie et omnium et singulorum quorum vel cuius exinde interest et poterit interesse dictoque notario Matheo presente procuratorio nomine antepredicto, penam ipsam a dictis venditrice et defensore seu et quolibet ipsorum sollempniter et legitime stipulantibus. Qua pena soluta vel non soluta aut graciose remissa presens nicholominus instrumentum cum eadem adiectione pene et omnibus in eo contentis semper in suo robore perseveret.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_21-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-15259-16583</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_21-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-15259-16583">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_21" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_21-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-15259-16583" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_21-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-15259-16583">
