  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_21-IURAMENTUM-19254-19966">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#iuramentum" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_21-IURAMENTUM-19254-19966" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Maioris quoque securitatis causa prefata Antonella venditrix et Mianus eius defensore sponte et voluntarie predicto die coram nobis iuraverunt supra Sancta Dei Evean gelia pro se et quilibet ipsorum corporaliter manu tacta prefato notario Matheo procuratore presente ibidem et sacramentum ibidem ab eis et quolibet ipsarum procuratorio nomine quo supra recipiente predicta omnia et singula que et qualiter preleguntur prefatis abbatisse et monialibus ac monasterio et ecclesie et eorum successoribus adimplere attendere et observare et contra ea vel ipsorum aliquod non facere dicere opponere allegare vel venire dicto facto vel opere puplice vel occulte in iudicio vel extra iudicium de iure seu modo quocumque.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_21-IURAMENTUM-19254-19966</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_21-IURAMENTUM-19254-19966">
