  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_22-PROROGATIO_IURISDICTIONIS-1830-2119">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#prorogatio-iurisdictionis" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_22-PROROGATIO_IURISDICTIONIS-1830-2119" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Que quidem moniales, consencientes prius in nos prefatos iudicem et notarium ut in suos expresse, cum scirent et ex certa earum scientia nos earum iudicem et notarium in hac parte non esse nec eas fore nostre iurisdicioni sub iectas, nostram iurisdicionem in se ipsas voluntarie prorogando</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_22-PROROGATIO_IURISDICTIONIS-1830-2119</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_22-PROROGATIO_IURISDICTIONIS-1830-2119">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_22" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_22-PROROGATIO_IURISDICTIONIS-1830-2119" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_22-PROROGATIO_IURISDICTIONIS-1830-2119">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1830</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">2119</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_22-RESTITUTIO_IN_INTEGRUM-8684-9370">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#restitutio-in-integrum" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_22-RESTITUTIO_IN_INTEGRUM-8684-9370" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">quodque si in solucione dicti census vel cultura debita ipsarum vinearum per annum unum cessaverit ipso iure et ipso facto cadat a concessione vinearum ipsarum ipse Nicolaus ac ab ipsis vineis et possessione ipsarum et ipse vinee cum iuribus earum deveniant ad monosterium supradictum liceatque eo casu dicto monosterio, auctori tate propria per se vel alium aut alios pro eo vineas capere et ingredi et apprehendere et ad eorum manus redducere et eciam revocare ipsumque Nicolaum expellere et con pelli facere et convenire super hiis taliter quod ipsum monosterium omni tempore anno quolibet, ut supra, percipiat et consequatur dictum ius tarenorum tresdecim sine impedimento quocumque</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_22-RESTITUTIO_IN_INTEGRUM-8684-9370</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_22-RESTITUTIO_IN_INTEGRUM-8684-9370">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_22" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_22-RESTITUTIO_IN_INTEGRUM-8684-9370" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_22-RESTITUTIO_IN_INTEGRUM-8684-9370">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">8684</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">9370</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_22-DEFENSIO-9376-9983">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#defensio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_22-DEFENSIO-9376-9983" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">ius tarenorum tresdecim ipse dompnus Iacobus quibus supra nominibus promisit et convenit dictis priorisse et monialibus presentibus et recipientibus libere defendere ab omnibus hominibus ex causa presentis et prime permutacionis predicte et e converso ipse priorissa et moniales pro dicto earum monasterio dicta casilla et domum permutacionis predicte similiter promiserunt et convenerunt dicto dompno Iacobo presenti et recipienti ab eo nomine quo supra libere inperpetuum defendere ab omnibus hominibus denunciandi necessitate evictionis tempore per ipsas ambas partes sibi ipsis invicem ex pacto remissa.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_22-DEFENSIO-9376-9983</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_22-DEFENSIO-9376-9983">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_22" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_22-DEFENSIO-9376-9983" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_22-DEFENSIO-9376-9983">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">9376</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">9983</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_22-OBLIGATIO-10355-11231">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_22-OBLIGATIO-10355-11231" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">sub expressa ypotheca et obligacione omnium et singulorum bonorum dictorum dompni Iacobi et Iohannis fratrum ac dicti Nicolai ubicumque sistentium, cum potestate capiendi intrandi et apprehendendi bona ipsa per ipsas moniales dicti monosterii, alium vel alios pro eis, auctoritate earum propria, sine licencia curie et decreto pretoris, sed solo presentis instrumenti vigore ipsaque incontinenti vendendi vel in solutum competenti precio retinendi servatis vel non servatis iuris et facti solempnitatibus, que requiruntur a iure in talibus, quousque premissa omnia eisdem monialibus adimpleantur et observentur cum refectione et emenda omnium dampnorum et expensarum, et eas inde penitus conservent indempnes, ipsis dompno Iacobo Iohanne et Nicolao defendentibus anteposicionem et obligacionem ipsas dictis monialibus et quibus bona ipsa ven ditta fuerint ab omnibus hominibus</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_22-OBLIGATIO-10355-11231</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_22-OBLIGATIO-10355-11231">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_22" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_22-OBLIGATIO-10355-11231" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_22-OBLIGATIO-10355-11231">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">10355</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">11231</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_22-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-11233-11700">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_22-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-11233-11700" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">ad penam et sub pena unciarum auri decem solvendarum pro medietate sancte romane curie vel reginali curie aut illi curie, ubi de premissis fuerit exinde proclamatum ipsis monialibus pro se ipsis et earum dicto monasterio et me prefato notario puplico tamquam persona puplica pro parte ipsius curie penam ipsam sollempniter et legitime stipulantibus que pena soluta vel non soluta aut graciose remissa presens nichilominus instrumentum semper in suo robore perseveret.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_22-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-11233-11700</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_22-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-11233-11700">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_22" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_22-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-11233-11700" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_22-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-11233-11700">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">11233</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">11700</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_22-RENUNTIATIO-11701-12366">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#renuntiatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_22-RENUNTIATIO-11701-12366" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Et renunciaverunt expresse et ex certa eorum scientia ipse dompnus Iacobus nomine quo supra et Nicolaus predictus speciali excepcioni doli mali vis metus et in factum accioni excepcioni predicte rei aliter geste quam scripte et presentis non sic celebrati contractus privilegio fori beneficio restitucionis in integrum legi rem maioris precii per quam deceptis in vendicionibus et permutacionibus ultra dimidium iusti precii subvenitur et omnibus aliis legibus beneficiis et constitucionibus quibus presentem permutacionem infrangere vel impugnare quoquomodo possent et specialiter legi dicenti generalem non valere legi etiam prohibenti talem renunciationem fieri.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_22-RENUNTIATIO-11701-12366</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
