  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_23-RESTITUTIO_IN_INTEGRUM-6029-6682">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#restitutio-in-integrum" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_23-RESTITUTIO_IN_INTEGRUM-6029-6682" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Et si per annum unum ipsi Marinus et Antonellus cessaverint vel alter ipsorum cessaverit in cultura predictarum vinearum debita vel dicti census solucione, quod in ipsis casibus et quolibet ipsorum cadant seu cadat ipsi Marinus et Antonellus vel alter ipsorum a concessione ipsarum vinearum facta eis vel alteri ipsorum per ipsum Masellum de vineis supradictis, liceatque et licitum sit dicte Pitrelle, auctoritate sua propria, sine iussu curie et decreto pretoris, capere et ingredi et apprehendere dictas vineas et ad domini possessionem et manus suas redducere et eciam revocare sine aliqua questione ipsorum Marini et Antonelli vel alterius ipsorum.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_23-RESTITUTIO_IN_INTEGRUM-6029-6682</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_23-RESTITUTIO_IN_INTEGRUM-6029-6682">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_23" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_23-RESTITUTIO_IN_INTEGRUM-6029-6682" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_23-RESTITUTIO_IN_INTEGRUM-6029-6682">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6029</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6682</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_23-OBLIGATIO-6683-7832">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_23-OBLIGATIO-6683-7832" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Pro quibus omnibus et singulis adimplendis et inviolabiliter observandis per eundem venditorem dicte emptrici, prefatus venditor voluntarie dicte emptrici presenti et stipulanti ab eo ut supra anteposuit et ypothecavit et obligavit omnia et singula bona sua mobilia et stabilia licita et illicita presencia et futura exsistencia ubicumque cum potestate capiendi intrandi et apprehendendi bona ipsa per ipsam emptricem et suos heredes auctoritate sua propria sine iussu curie et decreto pre toris sed solo presentis instrumenti vigore ipsaque bona incontinenti vendendi et quolibet alienacionis titulo distrahendi vel insolutum iusto et competenti precio retinendi servatis vel non servatis iuris et facti sollemnitatibus que in talibus requiruntur a iure donec predicta omnia et singula que et qualiter preleguntur eidem emptrici adimpleantur et observentur cum integra refectione et emenda omnium dampnorum expensarum et interesse litis et extra litem et se inde penitus conservet indempnem et ipso venditore defendente anteposicionem et obligacionem ipsas dicte emptrici et suis heredibus et quibus bona ipsa vendita fu erint ab omnibus hominibus.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_23-OBLIGATIO-6683-7832</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_23-OBLIGATIO-6683-7832">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_23" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_23-OBLIGATIO-6683-7832" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_23-OBLIGATIO-6683-7832">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6683</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">7832</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_23-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7833-8629">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_23-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7833-8629" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Contra que omnia et singula vel aliquod premissorum si prefatus venditor fecerit et prelecta omnia et singula que et qualiter perleguntur eidem emptrici non adimpleverit et obser vaverit pene nomine solvat et componat seu solvere et componere teneatur et debeat duplum dicte vendicionis precii medietatem videlicet ipsius pene dicte emptrici et reliquam medietatem pene eiusdem curie Reginali aut illi curie ubi de premissis fuerit exinde proclamatum et ipsaque emptrice pro se et suis heredibus et me prefacto notario puplico tamquam persona puplica pro parte ipsius curie penam ipsam sollempniter et legitime stipulantibus que pena soluta vel non soluta aut graciose remissa presens nichilominus instrumentum cum eadem adiectione pene et omnibus in eo contentis semper in suo robore perseveret.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_23-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7833-8629</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_23-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7833-8629">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_23" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_23-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7833-8629" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_23-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7833-8629">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">7833</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">8629</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_23-RENUNTIATIO-8630-9999">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#renuntiatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_23-RENUNTIATIO-8630-9999" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Super quibus omnibus et singulis prefatus venditor voluntarie dicte emptrici presenti et stipulanti ab eo ut supra, renunciavit expresse et ex certa eius scientia specialiter excepcioni doli mali vis metus et in factum accioni excepcioni predicte rei aliter geste quam scripte et presentis non sic celebrati contractus, privilegio fori, excepcioni predicte pecunie non recepte nec habite, epistole divi regis Adriani de dividendis accionibus, legi rem maioris precii per quam deceptis in vendicionibus ultra dimidium iusti precii subvenitur, legi de bonis mobilibus vel stabilibus insolutum dandis vel re tinendis, omni legum et utriusque iuris auxilio canonici et civilis, iuri scripto et non scripto edito vel edendo, usui consuetudinario constitucionario vel longobardo, iuri legi et consuetudini que penam in contractibus prohibent adhiberi et adhibitam non valere, consuetudini qua cavetur quod pena apposita in contractu nullum sortitur effectum, singulisque aliis iuribus legibus excepcionibus privilegiis literis beneficiis auxiliis consuetudinibus constitucionibus usibus remediis et statutis quibus seu ipsorum aliquo uti seu iuvare se posset et a presenti obligacione tueri et huius scripti tenor posset in parte vel in toto minui vel infringi et specialiter iuri dicenti generalem renunciacionem non valere, legi etiam prohibenti talem renunciacionem fieri.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_23-RENUNTIATIO-8630-9999</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_23-RENUNTIATIO-8630-9999">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_23" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_23-RENUNTIATIO-8630-9999" />
  </rdf:Description>
