  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_25-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-3328-3638">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#restrictio-alienationis" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_25-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-3328-3638" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">videlicet quod dictus Nardus et sui heredes possint et valeant vinealia ipsa durante dicta concessione vendere alienare permutare locare et dislocare salvis tamen annuo censu et pactis predictis ecclesiis et personis ecclesiasticiis poten tioribus vel miserabilibus personis ipsis monialibus dumtaxat exceptis.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_25-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-3328-3638</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_25-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-3328-3638">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_25" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_25-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-3328-3638" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_25-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-3328-3638">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">3328</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">3638</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_25-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-3639-4371">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#restitutio-cum-melioratione" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_25-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-3639-4371" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Item, quod prefatus Nardus conductor et sui heredes possint et valeant et teneantur dictum annuum censum tarenorum quatuor et medii dare et solvere census nomine in dicto termino ipsis monialibus et si cessaverint in solutione dicti census per biennium quod statim cadant a dicta concessione et dicta vinealia cum iuribus et omnibus supradictis ac meliorationibus factis in eis ad dictas moniales deveniant pleno iure. Quodque liceat et licitum sit dictis monialibus auctoritate earum propria sine licentia curie et decreto pretoris sed solo presentis instrumenti vigore, realiter et corporaliter capere et ingredi et ad earum proprium dominium reducere et eciam revocare, omni ipsius conductoris et heredum eius questione cessante.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_25-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-3639-4371</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_25-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-3639-4371">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_25" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_25-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-3639-4371" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_25-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-3639-4371">
