  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_25-OBLIGATIO-5324-6444">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_25-OBLIGATIO-5324-6444" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Pro quibus omnibus et singulis adimplendis et inviolabiliter observandis per dictum conductorem dictis monialibus prefatus conductor voluntarie dictis monialibus presentibus et stipulantibus ut supra anteposuit ypothecavit et obligavit omnia et singula bona sua et heredum eius mobilia et stabilia licita et illicita presencia et futura ubicumque sistencia cum potestate capiendi intrandi et apprehendendi vendendi et alienandi bona ipsa per dictas moniales auctoritate earum propria, sine licentia curie et decreto pretoris sed solo presentis instrumenti vigore, vel inperpetuum iusto precio retinendi, servatis vel non servatis iuris et facti solemnitatibus que in talibus requiruntur a iure, donec predicta omnia et singula, que et qualiter perleguntur, eisdem monialibus adimpleantur et observentur cum integra refectione et emenda omnium damnorum expensarum et interesse passorum per dictas moniales, stando de eis sibi simplici verbo et eas exinde penitus conservet indemnes, ipso conductore defendente anteposicionem et obligationem ipsas dictis monialibus et quibus bona ipsa vendita fuerint ab omnibus hominibus</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_25-OBLIGATIO-5324-6444</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_25-OBLIGATIO-5324-6444">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_25" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_25-OBLIGATIO-5324-6444" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_25-OBLIGATIO-5324-6444">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">5324</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6444</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_25-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6445-6985">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_25-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6445-6985" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">ad penam unciarum sex de carlenis si prefatus conductor contrafecerit et dictis monialibus non observaverit. Cuius pene medietas applicetur dictis monialibus et reliqua medietas applicetur curie Reginali vel illi curie ubi de premissis fuerit exinde proclamatum ipsis monialibus pro se ipsis et earum monasterio et me prefacto notario puplico tamquam persona puplica pro parte ipsius curie penam sollempniter et legitime stipulantibus que pena soluta vel non soluta aut graciose remissa presens instrumentum semper in suo robore perseveret.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_25-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6445-6985</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_25-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6445-6985">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_25" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_25-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6445-6985" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_25-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6445-6985">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6445</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6985</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_25-RENUNTIATIO-6986-7946">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#renuntiatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_25-RENUNTIATIO-6986-7946" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Et renunciavit conductor Nardus dictis monialibus exceptioni doli mali vis metus et in factum actioni, exceptioni predicte rei aliter geste quam scripte et presentis non sic celebrati contractus, privilegio seu nundinarum Baroli Trani et aliarum terrarum quarumcumque, exceptioni beneficii restitutionis in integrum, omni legum et utriusque iuris auxilio canonici et civilis, iuri scripto et non scripto edito vel edendo, usui consuetudinario constitutionario vel longobardo, iuri legi et consuetudini que penam in contractibus prohibent adhiberi et adhibitam non valere consuetudini qua cavetur quod pena apposita in contractu nullum sortiatur effectum, singulisque aliis iuribus legibus exceptionibus privilegiis et statutis, quibus seu ipsorum aliquo uti seu iuvare se possit et tueri in contra rium forte eloquentibus non obstantibus quoquo modo et specialiter legi dicenti generalem renunciationem non valere et legi prohibenti talem renunciationem fieri.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_25-RENUNTIATIO-6986-7946</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_25-RENUNTIATIO-6986-7946">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_25" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_25-RENUNTIATIO-6986-7946" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_25-RENUNTIATIO-6986-7946">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6986</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">7946</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_25-IURAMENTUM-7947-8251">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#iuramentum" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_25-IURAMENTUM-7947-8251" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Maioris quoque securitatis causa prefatus conductor voluntarie dictis monialibus presentibus et recipientibus ut supra iuravit ad Sancta Dei Evangelia per eum corporaliter manu tacta predicta omnia et singula adimplere et observare et contra non facere vel venire de iure vel de facto seu modo quocumque.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_25-IURAMENTUM-7947-8251</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_25-IURAMENTUM-7947-8251">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_25" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_25-IURAMENTUM-7947-8251" />
  </rdf:Description>
