  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_26-OBLIGATIO-5001-6313">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_26-OBLIGATIO-5001-6313" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">pro quibus omnibus et singulis adimplendis attendendis et inviolabiliter observa ndis ac de non veniendo [...] dictus Raynaldus pro se et suis heredibus quibus de moniali eidem emptori presenti recipenti et stipulanti ab eo ut supra anteposuit, ypothecavit et obligavit omnia et singula bona sua dicti presenti et stipulanti heredum suorum mobilya et stabilia licita et illicita presencia et futura exsistencia ubicumque cum potestate capiendi intrandi et apprehendendi bona ipsa per ipsum [ad bio sum] et suos heredes auctoritate propria nullius proinde curie iudicis presidis seu pretoris exspectata licencia seu mandato sed solo presentis instrumenti vigore ipsaque capta incontinenti vendendi et quolibet alienacionis titulo distrahendi et quolibet alie nacionis titulo dixstrahendi servatis vel non servatis iuris et facti sollempnitatibus que in talibus requiruntur a iure, donec predicta omnia et singula que et qualiter prele guntur dicto emptori et suis heredibus adimpleantur et observentur cum integra refectione et emenda omnium dampnorum expensarum et interesse litis et extra litem et cum petente conser vatur indempnem dicto quoque Raynaldo venditoribus quolibet supra et suis heredibus defendentibus bona ipsa vendita successori et suis heredibus et quibus ea vendita fuerint ab omnibus hominibus</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_26-OBLIGATIO-5001-6313</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_26-OBLIGATIO-5001-6313">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_26" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_26-OBLIGATIO-5001-6313" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_26-OBLIGATIO-5001-6313">
