    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6313</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_26-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6314-6808">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_26-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6314-6808" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">ad penam et sub pena unciarum quatuor carlenorum argenti ponderis generalis parti et curie, si contrafacerit seu fecerint, propterea applicanda ipso quoque dompno Mictulo pro se et suis heredibus et me prefato notario puplico tamquam persona puplica pro parte ipsius curie penam ipsam sollemniter et legitime stipulantibus qua pena soluta vel non soluta aut graciose remissa presens nichilominus instrumentum cum eadem adiectione pene et omnibus in eo contentis semper in suo robore perseveret.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_26-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6314-6808</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_26-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6314-6808">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_26" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_26-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6314-6808" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_26-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6314-6808">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6314</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6808</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_26-RENUNTIATIO-6809-7797">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#renuntiatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_26-RENUNTIATIO-6809-7797" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Super quibus omnibus et eorum singulis voluntarie dictus Magister Raynaldus pro se et suis heredibus et successoribus dopno Mictulo presenti recipienti et stipulanti ab eo renunciavit expresse et ex certa sua scientia speciali exceptioni doli mali vis et metus et in factum accioni excepcioni predicte rei aliter geste quam scrip te et presentis non sic celebrati contractus excepcioni dicte pecunie non numerate non ponderate et assignate ut supra omni legum et utriusque iuris auxilio canonici et civilis, iuri scripto et non scripto edito vel edendo et que penam in contractibus prohibent adhiberi et adhibitam non valere consuetudi ni qua cavetur quod pena apposita in contractu nullum sortiatur effectum singulisque aliis iuribus legibus usibus et consuetudinibus quibus se ipsorum quomodolibet aiutari vel huius scripti tenorem parte vel in toto a minuere vel infrangi et specialiter iuri dicenti generalem renunciacionem non valere legi etiam prohibenti talem renunciacionem fieri.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_26-RENUNTIATIO-6809-7797</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_26-RENUNTIATIO-6809-7797">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_26" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_26-RENUNTIATIO-6809-7797" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_26-RENUNTIATIO-6809-7797">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6809</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">7797</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_26-IURAMENTUM-7798-8264">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#iuramentum" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_26-IURAMENTUM-7798-8264" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Maioris quoque securitatis causa voluntarie dictus Magister Raynaldus eidem dopno Mictulo emptori presenti recipienti et stipulanti ab eo ut supra iuravit ad Sancta dei Evangelia per eum corporaliter manu tacta predicta omnia et singula que et qualiter per leguntur dicto dopno Mictulo et suis heredibus et successoribus adimplere attendere et inviolabiliter observare et contra non facere dicere opponere allegare vel venire de iure vel de facto seu modo quocumque.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_26-IURAMENTUM-7798-8264</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_26-IURAMENTUM-7798-8264">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_26" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_26-IURAMENTUM-7798-8264" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_26-IURAMENTUM-7798-8264">
