  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_27-OBLIGATIO-4372-5394">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_27-OBLIGATIO-4372-5394" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Pro quibus omnibus et singulis adimplendis et inviolabiliter observandis per [dictum] seu dictos venditores prefato emptori ipsis venditores voluntarie dicto emptori presenti et stipulanti ut supra anteposuerunt ypothecaverunt et obligaverunt omnia et singula bona eorum et heredum eorum mobilia et stabilia licita et illicita presencia et futura ubicumque sistencia cum potestate capiendi intrandi et apprehendendi vendendi et alienandi bona ipsa per ipsum emptorem et suos heredes auctoritate sua propria sine licentia curie et decreto pretoris solo presentis intrumenti vigore vel insolutum iusto precio retinendi, servatis vel non servatis iuris et facti sollempnitatibus que in talibus requiruntur a iure usque ad integram satisfationem dictorum omnium et singulorum cum emenda damnorum expensarum passorum per ipsum emptorem stando de eis soli exinde dicto emptores et eum exinde penitus conservent indempnem ipsis venditoribus anteposicionem ipsum defendentibus quibus bona ipsa vendita fuerint ab omnibus hominibus</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_27-OBLIGATIO-4372-5394</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_27-OBLIGATIO-4372-5394">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_27" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_27-OBLIGATIO-4372-5394" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_27-OBLIGATIO-4372-5394">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">4372</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">5394</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_27-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5395-5902">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_27-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5395-5902" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">ad penam et sub pena dupli supradicte pecunie quantitatis, si contra fecerint ipsi venditores, cuius pene medietas applicetur dicto emptori et suis heredibus et reliqua medietas applicetur curie regie aut illi curie ubi de premissis fuerit exinde proclamatum ipso emptore pro se et suis heredibus et me prefato notario puplico tamquam persona puplica pro parte ipsius curie penam ipsam sollemniter et legitime stipulantibus qua pena soluta vel non soluta presens instrumentum semper in suo robore perseveret</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_27-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5395-5902</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_27-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5395-5902">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_27" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_27-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5395-5902" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_27-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5395-5902">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">5395</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">5902</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_27-RENUNTIATIO-5903-7090">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#renuntiatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_27-RENUNTIATIO-5903-7090" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">et renunciaverunt dicti venditores prefato emptori, presenti et stipulanti ut supra, exceptioni doli mali vis metus et in factum actioni, exceptioni predicte rei aliter geste quam scripte et presentis non sic celebrati contractus privilegio fori, beneficio restitutionis in integrum, auxilio Velleani senatus consulti, legi rem maioris precii per quam deceptis in venditionibus ultra dimidium iusti pretii subveni tur omni legum et utriusque iuris auxilio canonici et civilis, iuri scripto et non scripto edito vel edendo, usui consuetudinario vel longobardo, iuri legi vel consuetudini, que penam in contractibus prohibent adhiberi et adhibitam non valere, consuetudini qua cavetur quod pena apposita in contractu nullum sortiatur effectum, singulisque aliis iuribus legibus exceptionibus privilegiis litteris et statutis, quibus seu ipsorum aliquo uti seu iuvare se possent et tueri et huius scripti tenor posset in toto vel in parte minui vel infringi et specialiter iuri dicenti generalem renunciationem non valere. Certiorata prius exilivit dicta mulier ut dixit de per iurisperitos viros de omnibus et singulis legibus et exceptionibus et eorum effectibus, quid sint et quid dicant</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_27-RENUNTIATIO-5903-7090</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_27-RENUNTIATIO-5903-7090">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_27" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_27-RENUNTIATIO-5903-7090" />
  </rdf:Description>
