  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_29-OBLIGATIO-4970-6165">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_29-OBLIGATIO-4970-6165" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Pro quibus omnibus et singulis adimplendis et inviolabiliter observandis et suis successoribus ad predicta venditor prefatus Nardus dictis monialibus presentibus et stipulantibus ut supra ut supra anteposuit ypotecavit et obligavit omnia et singula bona sua suorumque heredum mobilia et stabilia licita et illicita presencia et futura existencia ubicumque omnes actiones et iura ac nomina et cognomina debitorum cum potestate capiendi intrandi et apprehendendi bona ipsa per easdem moniales vel earum successores acutoritate earum propria nullius proinde curie iudicis presidis vel pretoris exspectata licentia seu mandato sed solo presentis instrumenti vigore ipsaque bona capta statim et inconvenienti vendendi et quo libet alienacionis titulo distrahendi vel in solutum iure crediti iusto et competenti precio retinendi servatis vel non servatis iuris et facti sollempni tatibusque in talibus requiruntur adimpleantur et observentur cum integra refectione et emenda omnium dapnorum expensarum et interesse litis et extra litem et se inde penitus conservent indepmnes ipso modo conductore defendente anteposicionem et obligacionem ipsas et quibus ipsa bona vendita fuerint ab omnibus hominibus</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_29-OBLIGATIO-4970-6165</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_29-OBLIGATIO-4970-6165">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_29" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_29-OBLIGATIO-4970-6165" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_29-OBLIGATIO-4970-6165">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">4970</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6165</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_29-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6166-6822">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_29-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6166-6822" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">ad penam et sub pena unciarum quatuor si prefatus Nardus vel sui heredes contrafece rint et premissa non observaverint cuius pene medietas applicetur dictis monialibus vel eorum successorunt et reliqua ipsius pene medietas app licetur curie rege aut illi curie coram qua reclamatio seu querela de inde forte fiet dicto Nardo vel sui heredibus et successoribus et notaro puplice itamquam persona puplica nomine et pro parte ipsius curie penam ipsam sollemniter et legitime stipulantibus qua pena soluta el non soluta aut graciosa remissa presens nichilominus instrumentum cum eadem adyectione pene et omnibus in eo contentis semper in suo robore perseveret.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_29-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6166-6822</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_29-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6166-6822">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_29" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_29-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6166-6822" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_29-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-6166-6822">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6166</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6822</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_29-RENUNTIATIO-6823-7859">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#renuntiatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_29-RENUNTIATIO-6823-7859" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Super quibus omnibus et eorum singulis voluntarie prefatus conductor dictis concedentibus presentibus et stipulantibus ut supra renunciavit speciali exceptioni doli mali vis metus et in factum actioni exceptioni predicte rey aliter geste quam scripte et presentis non sic celebrati contractus actioni exceptioni dictorum vinealium nec non defensarum legi de bonis mobilibus vel stabilibus in solutum dandis vel retinendis capitulo regio prohibenti boves aratorios et instrumenta ad agriculturam pertinentia obligari capi et detineri non posse privilegio seu nundinarum Baroli Trani Andrie et aliorum locorum quorumcumque omnique legum et utriusque auxilio canonici et civilis iuri legi et consuetudini quod pena aposita in contractu nullum sortiatur effectum singulisque aliis iuribus legibus remediis et statutis licteris cedulis privilegis moratoriis indultis franchiciis et salvis conductibus impetratis vel impetrandis et specialiter iuri dicenti generalem renunciationem non valere legi eciam prohibenti talem renunciationem fieri.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_29-RENUNTIATIO-6823-7859</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_29-RENUNTIATIO-6823-7859">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_29" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_29-RENUNTIATIO-6823-7859" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_29-RENUNTIATIO-6823-7859">
