  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_30-OBLIGATIO-2951-4129">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_30-OBLIGATIO-2951-4129" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">pro quibus omnibus et singulis adimplendis et inviolabiliter observandis ac de non contraveniendo ad predicta et sponte prefatus prior et se dominus conductoribus presenti et stipulanti ut supra anteposuit ipotecavit obligavit omnia et singula bona dicti monasterii mobilia et stabilia licita et illicita presencia et futura existencia ubicumque actiones et iura ac nomina et cognomina debitorum cum potestate capiendi intrandi et apprehendendi bona ipsam persona et conductoris vel fare habere auctoritate propria nullius proinde curie iudicis presidis vel pretoris exspectata licentia seu manda to sed solo presentis instrumenti vigore ipsaque bona capta statim et incontinenti e vendendi et quolibet alienacionis titulo distrahendi vel in solutum iure crediti iusto precio retinendi servatis vel non iuris et facti sollempnita tibus que in talibus requiruntur a adimpleantur et observentur cum integra refectione et emenda omnium dampnorum expensarum et interesse litis et extra litem et eos inde penitus conservent indepmnes ipsis mon ialibus vel earum successoribus defendentibus anteposicionem et obligacionem ipsas et quibus ipsa bona vendita fuerint ab omnibus hominibus</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_30-OBLIGATIO-2951-4129</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_30-OBLIGATIO-2951-4129">
