  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_31-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-3854-4715">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#restitutio-cum-melioratione" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_31-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-3854-4715" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Et si forte ipse conductor aut sui successores cessaverint per biennium a solutione ipsius census seu a cultura ipsarum vinearum constituendarum ut supra, quod statim in istis casibus et quolibet ipsorum, cadant a presenti concessione et vinealia predicta cum omni beneficio et melioratione factis et faciendis in eisdem deveniant et devenire debeant ad manus et posse ipsarum monialium et earum successorum. Et liceat et licitum sit eisdem monialibus et earum successoribus, auctoritate earum propria, sine licencia curie et decreto pretoris, sed solo presentis instrumenti vigore, ipsa quoque vinealia cum eorum iuribus cum toto beneficio facto et faciendo in eisdem capere ingredi et apprehendere et ad pristinum statum ipsius ecclesie reducere et advocare, omni et qualibet ipsius conductoris vel eius heredum et successorum lite et contradictione cessante.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_31-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-3854-4715</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_31-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-3854-4715">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_31" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_31-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-3854-4715" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_31-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-3854-4715">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">3854</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">4715</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_31-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-4716-5388">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#restrictio-alienationis" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_31-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-4716-5388" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Item, quod dictus conductor suique heredes et successores possent et valeant ipsa vinealia cum toto beneficio et melioratione factis et faciendis in eisdem vendere alienare permutare in dotem tradere seu quovis aliquo modo distrahere, salvo tamen annuo censu et pactis predictis et infrascriptis, ecclesiis vero ecclesiasticisque personis et aliis potentioribus vel inpotentioribus, propter quas dicti census solutio et ipsarum vinearum cultura possent minui quomodolibet vel differri; eciam ex pacto promisit quod in ultimo et in extremo vite sue non audeat legare ipsa vinealia alicui ecclesie Baroli, nisi ecclesie et monasterio predicto sancte Lucie dumtaxat exceptis.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_31-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-4716-5388</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_31-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-4716-5388">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_31" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_31-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-4716-5388" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_31-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-4716-5388">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">4716</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">5388</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_31-DEFENSIO-5833-6050">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#defensio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_31-DEFENSIO-5833-6050" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">quin ymmo dicta vinealia cum iuribus suis sibi libere defendere et antestare ab omnibus hominibus et personis, denunciandi tamen necessitate evictionis tempore per easdem concedentes eidem conductori ex pacto remissa.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_31-DEFENSIO-5833-6050</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_31-DEFENSIO-5833-6050">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_31" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_31-DEFENSIO-5833-6050" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_31-DEFENSIO-5833-6050">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">5833</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6050</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_31-OBLIGATIO-6399-7720">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_31-OBLIGATIO-6399-7720" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Pro quibus omnibus et eorum singulis adimplendis et inviolabiliter observandis ac de non contraveniendo ad predicta omnia et singula voluntarie prefatus conductor eisdem concedentibus, presenti bus recipientibus et stipulantibus ut supra, anteposuit ypothecavit et obligavit omnia et bona sua suorumque heredum et successorum mobilia et stabilia licita et illicita presencia et futura, existencia ubicumque, actiones et iura ac nomina et cognomina debitorum, cum potestate capiendi intrandi et apprehendendi bona ipsa per ipsas concedente vel ipsarum successores auctoritate eorum propria sine licentia curie et decreto pretoris sed solo presentis instrumenti vigore ipsaque bona capta statim et incontinenti vendendi et quolibet alienacionis titulo distrahendi vel insolutum iusto et competenti precio retinendi servatis vel non servatis vel non servatis iuris et facti sollempnitatibus que in talibus requiruntur a iure donec predicta omnia et singula que et qualiter perleguntur adimpleantur et observentur cum integra refectione emenda omnium et singulorum dapnorum expensarum et interesse litis et extra litem et se inde penitus conservent indepmnes ipso quoque conductore suisque heredibus et successoribus defendentibus anteposicionem et obligacionem ipsas et quibus ipsa bona vendita fuerint ab omnibus hominibus.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_31-OBLIGATIO-6399-7720</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_31-OBLIGATIO-6399-7720">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_31" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_31-OBLIGATIO-6399-7720" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_31-OBLIGATIO-6399-7720">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
