    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">7720</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_31-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7721-8523">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_31-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7721-8523" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Contra que omnia et singula aut aliquod premissorum si prefatus conductor aut sui heredes et successores fecerint et premissa omnia et singula que et qualiter preleguntur non adimpleverint et observaverint. Cuius pene medietas applicetur dictis concedentibus vel eorum successoribus et alia medietas eiusdem pene curie regie vel illi curie ubi de premissis omnibus et singulis fuerit exinde proclamatum videlicet uncias quatuor de carlenis dictis concedendi per se ipsis earumque successoribus meque prefato notario publico tamquam persona publica nomine et pro parte ipsius curie penam ipsam sollemniter et legitime stipulantibus qua pena soluta vel non soluta aut graciosa remissa presens nichilominus instrumentum cum eadem adyectione pene et omnibus in eo contentis semper in suo robore perseveret.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_31-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7721-8523</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_31-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7721-8523">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_31" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_31-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7721-8523" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_31-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-7721-8523">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">7721</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">8523</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_31-RENUNTIATIO-8524-9897">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#renuntiatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_31-RENUNTIATIO-8524-9897" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Super quibus omnibus et eorum singulis adimplendis et inviolabiliter observandis ac de non contravenendo ad predicta omnia et singula voluntarie prefatus conductor eisdem concedentibus presentibus recipientibus et sti pulantibus ex certa sui scientia et non pro errore renunciavit specialiter exceptioni doli moli vis metus et in factum actioni exceptioni predicte rey aliter geste quam scripte et presentis non sic celebrati contractus legi de bonis mobilibus vel stabilibus insolutum dandis vel retindis de privilegio fori seu nundinarum Baroli Trani Andrie et aliorum locorum quorumcunque omnique legum et utriusque iuris auxilio canonici et civilis iuri scripto et non scripto edito vel edendo, usui consuetudinario constitutionario vel longobardo iuri legi et consuetudini que penam in contractibus prohibent ad hiberi et adhibitam non valere consuetudini qua caveatur quod pena apposita in contractu nullum sortiatur effectum, singulisque aliis iuribus legibus usibus remediis et statutis licteris cedulis privilegis scriptis et non scriptis moratoriis indultis franchiciis et salvis conductibus impetratis vel impetrandis quibus seu ipsorum aliquo uti seu iuvare se possent et tueri et huius scripti tenor posset in toto vel in parte minui vel infringi et specialiter iuri dicenti generalem renunciationem non valere legi etiam prohibenti talem renunciacionem fieri.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_31-RENUNTIATIO-8524-9897</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_31-RENUNTIATIO-8524-9897">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_31" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_31-RENUNTIATIO-8524-9897" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_31-RENUNTIATIO-8524-9897">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">8524</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">9897</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_31-IURAMENTUM-9898-10273">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#iuramentum" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_31-IURAMENTUM-9898-10273" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Maioris quoque securitatis causa voluntarie prefatus conductor eisdem monialibus presentibus et stipulantibus ut supra. Iuravit supra Sancta Dei Evangelia per eum corporaliter manu tacta predicta omnia et singula que et qualiter perleguntur libere adimplere attendere et observare contra non facere dicere opponere allegare vel venire de iure vel de facto seu modo quocumque.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_31-IURAMENTUM-9898-10273</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_31-IURAMENTUM-9898-10273">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_31" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_31-IURAMENTUM-9898-10273" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_31-IURAMENTUM-9898-10273">
