  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_33-DEFENSIO-3844-4242">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#defensio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_33-DEFENSIO-3844-4242" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">vineas ipsas et dictum beneficium defendere et antestare libere ab omnibus hominibus, salvo censu tarenorum trium et granorum [lacuna ..que] solvendorum per eundem venditorem eiusque heredes et successores eidem domino priori eiusque successoribus pro dictis vineis, denunciandi tamen necessitate evictionis tempore per eundem dominum prio [lacuna] eidem emptori eiusque heredibus ex pacto remissa.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_33-DEFENSIO-3844-4242</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_33-DEFENSIO-3844-4242">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_33" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_33-DEFENSIO-3844-4242" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_33-DEFENSIO-3844-4242">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">3844</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">4242</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_33-OBLIGATIO-4623-5860">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_33-OBLIGATIO-4623-5860" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">pro quibus omnibus et singulis adimplendis et inviolabiliter observandis ac de non contravenendo ad premissa voluntarie prefatus venditor dicto emptori presenti et stipulanti ut supra anteposuit ypothecavit et obligavit omnia et singula bona sua suorumque successorum mobilia et stabilia licita et illicita presencia et futura ubicumque existenc ia actiones et iura ac nomina et cognomina debitorum, cum potestate capiendi intrandi et apprehendendi bona ipsa per cumdemptore et de eiusque heredum auctoritate propria omnia licentiam et decreto pretoris. Sed solo presentis instrumenti vigore ipsaque bona capta statim et in continenti vendendi et quolibet alienacionis titulo distrahendi vel in solutum iure crediti per iusto et competenti precio retinendi servatis vel non servatis iuris et facti sollempnitatibus, que in talibus a iure requiruntur et debet. Donec predicta omnia et singula, que et qualiter preleguntur eidem emptori eisdem heredibus adimpleantur et observantur. Cum integra refectione et emenda omnium dampnorum expensarum et interesse litis et extra litem et se inde penitus conservent indemnes ipsoque venditore defendente antepositionem et obligationem ipsas et quibus bona ipsa vendita fuerint ab omnibus hominibus</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_33-OBLIGATIO-4623-5860</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_33-OBLIGATIO-4623-5860">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_33" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_33-OBLIGATIO-4623-5860" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_33-OBLIGATIO-4623-5860">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">4623</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">5860</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_33-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5861-6450">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_33-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5861-6450" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">ad penam et sub pena unciarum decem carlenorum, cuius pene medietas applicetur dicto emptori et suisque heredibus et successoribus. Et reliqua eiusdem pene medietas curie romane vel illi curie ubi de predictis exinde fuerit proclamatum dicto emptore pro se et pro parte sua et me prefato puplico tamquam puplica persona puplica notario e et pro parte ipsius curie penam ipsam sollemniter et legitime stipulantibus. Qua pena soluta vel non soluta aut graciosa remissa presens nichilominus instrumentum cum eadem adiectione penarum et omnibus in eo contentis semper in suo robore perseveret.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_33-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5861-6450</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_33-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5861-6450">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_33" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_33-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5861-6450" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_33-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5861-6450">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">5861</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6450</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_33-RENUNTIATIO-6451-7501">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#renuntiatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_33-RENUNTIATIO-6451-7501" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Super quibus omnibus et eorum singulis voluntarie prefatus venditor eidem emptori presenti et stipulanti ex certa sui scientia et non pro errore renunciavit specialiter exceptioni doli mali vis metus et in factum actioni exceptioni eorum predicte rey aliter geste quam scripte et presentis non sic celebrati omnis restitutionis in integrum omni perle[lacuna] et utriusque iuris auxilio canonici et civilis iuri scripto et non scripto edito vel edendo, usui consuetudinario constitutionario vel longobardo iuri legi et consuetudini que penam in contractibus prohibent ad(lacuna) et adhibitam non valere consuetudini qua caveatur quod pena apposita in contractu nullum sortiatur effectum, singulisque aliis iuribus legibus privilegis scripti et non scripti impetratis vel impetrandis quibus(lacuna) seu ipsorum. Et uti seu iuvare se possent et presentis obligacione tueri et huius scripti tenor posset in toto vel in parte minui vel infringi et specialiter iuri dicenti generalem renunciationem non valere legi et prohibenti talem renunciacionem fieri.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_33-RENUNTIATIO-6451-7501</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_33-RENUNTIATIO-6451-7501">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_33" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_33-RENUNTIATIO-6451-7501" />
  </rdf:Description>
