  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_35-OBLIGATIO-4851-5947">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_35-OBLIGATIO-4851-5947" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Pro quibus omnibus et singulis adimplendis et observandis ac de non contraveniendo voluntarie prefate partes una alteri ut supra anteposuerunt ypothecaverunt et obligaverunt omnia et singula bona dicte ecclesie et conductoris predicti mobilia et immobilia presencia et futura existencia ubicumque et nomina debitorum precario nomine cum pote state capiendi intrandi et apprehendendi bona ipsam persona auctoritate nullus proinde iudicis presidis vel pretoris expectata licentia seu mandato sed solo presentis instrumenti vigore ipsaque bona capta incontinenti et vendendi et quolibet alienacionis titulo distrahendi vel in solutum iusto precio retinendi servatis vel non servatis iuris et facti sollempnitatibus que in talibus requiruntur a iure donec omnia et singula que et qualiter perleguntur adimpleantur et observentur cum integra refectione et emenda omnium damnorum expensarum et interesse litis et extra litem et se inde penitus conservent indempnes ipsisque partibus defendentibus anteposicionem et obligacionem ipsas et quibus ipsa bona vendita fuerint ab omnibus hominibus et personis</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_35-OBLIGATIO-4851-5947</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_35-OBLIGATIO-4851-5947">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_35" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_35-OBLIGATIO-4851-5947" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_35-OBLIGATIO-4851-5947">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">4851</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">5947</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_35-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5948-6492">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_35-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5948-6492" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">ad penam et sub pena unciarum decem carlenorum si predicta non adimpleverint vel contra fecerint cuius pene medietas applicetur parti sevanti et reliqua medietas illi curie ubi de premissis fuerit proclamatum ipsis partibus per se ipso et earum heredes et successores et me prefato notario puplico tamquam persona puplica penam ipsam sollempniter et legitime stipulantibus qua pena soluta vel non soluta aut graciosa remissa presens nichilominus instrumentum cum eadem adiectione pene et omnibus in eo contentis semper in suo robore perseveret.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_35-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-5948-6492</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
