  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_35-RENUNTIATIO-6493-7374">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#renuntiatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_35-RENUNTIATIO-6493-7374" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Super quibus omnibus et singulis voluntarie prefate partes una alteri ut supra renunciaverunt speciali exceptioni doli mali vis metus et in facto actioni exceptioni predicte rei aliter gestae quam scripte et presentis non sic celebrati contractus privilegio fori capitulo assistencie terre Baroli omnique legum et utriusque iuris auxilio canonici et civilis iuri scripto et non scripto eddito vel eddendo usui consuetudinario constitucionario vel longobardo iuri legi et consuetudini que penam in contractibus prohibent adhiberi et adhibitam non valere singulisque aliis iuribus legibus privilegiis et beneficiis. Quibus seu ipsorum altero uti seu iuvare se possent et a presenti obligatione tueri et huius scripti tenor posset in toto vel in parte minui vel infringi et specialiter iuri dicenti generalem renunciationem non valere legi etiam prohibenti talem renunciationem fieri.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_35-RENUNTIATIO-6493-7374</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_35-RENUNTIATIO-6493-7374">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_35" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_35-RENUNTIATIO-6493-7374" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_35-RENUNTIATIO-6493-7374">
