  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_36-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-4364-5162">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#restitutio-cum-melioratione" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_36-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-4364-5162" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Item si prefatus conductor vel sui heredes cessaverit seu cessaverint per biennium tam a reparacione dicte domus quam a soluccione dicti annui census quod hiis casibus seu ipsorum altero cadat seu cadant a presenti concessione et dicta domus cum omni melioracione et beneficio in ea factis deveniat et devenire debeat pleno iure ad dictum monasterium et ecclesiam sine questione et contrarietate aliqua liceat licitumque sit dictis monialibus et earum successoribus dictam domum auctoritate propria sine licencia curie et decreto pretoris solo tamen presentis instrumenti vigore capere et apprehendere domum ipsam et ad pristinum dominium ipsius ecclesie et monasterii reducere et eciam revocare omni et qualibet ipsius conductoris et heredum eius questione et contrarietate cessantibus et sopitis.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_36-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-4364-5162</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_36-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-4364-5162">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_36" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_36-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-4364-5162" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_36-RESTITUTIO_CUM_MELIORATIONE-4364-5162">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">4364</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">5162</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_36-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-5611-6197">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#restrictio-alienationis" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_36-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-5611-6197" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Item quod dictus con ductor et sui heredes possint et valeant dictam domum cum omni beneficio et melioracione in ea factis vendere alienare permutare donare concedere in dotem traddere seu quovis alio modo distrahere salvo semper dicto annuo censu pactis et condiccionibus supradictis et infrascriptis ecclesiis vero ecclesiasticisque personis miserabilibus potencioribus et inpotencioribus per quas dicti census solucio et dicte domus reparaccio impediri possit minui vel quomodolibet infringi vel differi dumtaxat exceptis. Requisita prius ecclesia ipsa in casu alienacionis predicte.</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_36-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-5611-6197</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_36-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-5611-6197">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_36" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_36-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-5611-6197" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_36-RESTRICTIO_ALIENATIONIS-5611-6197">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">5611</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6197</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_36-OBLIGATIO-6785-8067">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#obligatio" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_36-OBLIGATIO-6785-8067" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">Pro quibus omnibus et singulis adimplendis et observandis ac de non contraveniendo ad predicta voluntarie prefatus conductor pro se et suis heredibus dictis concedentibus presentibus et stipulantibus ut supra anteposuit ypothecavit et obligavit omnia et singula bona sua suorumque heredum mobilia et stabilia licita et inlicita presencia et futura exstensia ubicumque acciones et iura ac nomina et cognomina debitorum cum potestate capiendi intrandi et apprehendendi tenendi et possidendi bona ypsa per dictas moniales et earum successores auctoritate propria sine licentia curie presidis vel pretoris. Sed solo presentis instrumenti vigore ipsaque bona capta incontinenti vendendi et quolibet alienacionis titulo distrahendi vel insolutum iure crediti iusto precio retinendi servatis vel non servatis iuris et facti sollempnitatibus que in talibus requiruntur a iure donec prolecta omnia et singula que et qualiter preleguntur adimpleantur et observentur cum integra refeccione et emenda omnium damnorum expensarum et interesse litis et extra litem et se inde penitus conservet indenpnem ipsoque conductore per se et suius heredibus dictis concedentibus et earum successoribus defendente anteposicionem et obligacionem ipsas et quibus ipsa bona vendita fuerint ab omnibus hominibus</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_36-OBLIGATIO-6785-8067</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_36-OBLIGATIO-6785-8067">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_36" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_36-OBLIGATIO-6785-8067" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_36-OBLIGATIO-6785-8067">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">6785</oa:start>
    <oa:end rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">8067</oa:end>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#BCSL_36-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-8068-8744">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#Annotation" />
    <oa:hasBody rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_repertoire.ttl#sanctio-negativa" />
    <oa:hasTarget rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_36-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-8068-8744" />
    <rdf:value xml:lang="la">ad penam et sub pena unciarum quinque de carlenis si prefatus conductor contrafecerit et premissa non observaverit cuius pene medietas applicetur dictis concedentibus et earum successoribus et reliqua ipsius pene medietas applicetur curie regie vel illi curie coram qua de premissis reclamaccio seu querela exinde forte fiet dictis concedentibus et earum successoribus meque prefato notario puplico tamquam persona puplica nomine et pro parte ipsius curie penam ipsam sollemniter et legitime stipulantibus qua pena soluta vel non soluta aut graciose remissa presens nichilominus instrumentum cum eadem adieccione pene et omnibus in eo contentis semper in suo robore perseveret</rdf:value>
    <dct:identifier>BCSL_36-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-8068-8744</dct:identifier>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#target-BCSL_36-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-8068-8744">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#SpecificResource" />
    <oa:hasSource rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#document-BCSL_36" />
    <oa:hasSelector rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_36-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-8068-8744" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GiuConso/Formulas_semantics/main/vocabulary/clause_examples.ttl#selector-BCSL_36-SANCTIO_NEGATIVA-8068-8744">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#TextPositionSelector" />
    <oa:start rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">8068</oa:start>
